Usage:
  /usr/bin/ostree refs [OPTION?] [PREFIX]

List refs

Help Options:
  -h, --help            Show help options

Application Options:
  --repo=PATH           Path to OSTree repository (defaults to current directory or /sysroot/ostree/repo)
  --delete              Delete refs which match PREFIX, rather than listing them
  --list                Do not remove the prefix from the refs
  -r, --revision        Show revisions in listing
  -A, --alias           If used with --create, create an alias, otherwise just list aliases
  --create=NEWREF       Create a new ref for an existing commit
  -c, --collections     Enable listing collection IDs for refs
  --force               Overwrite existing refs when creating
  -v, --verbose         Print debug information during command processing
  --version             Print version information and exit

error: Command requires a --repo argument
